WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.436 line:100%,end
The service book is visible only to the administrator.

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:08.500 line:100%,end
Open the unit on the Fleet page
and scroll to Service history.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.872 line:100%,end
Click Open the service book.

00:00:10.872 --> 00:00:18.700 line:100%,end
It shows the unit details, services with dates
and meter readings, and the parts replaced.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.878 line:100%,end
Click Print or save PDF.

00:00:21.878 --> 00:00:29.600 line:100%,end
Choose a printer or Save as PDF
and the service book is saved on your computer.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:34.028 line:100%,end
Download CSV opens the same history in Excel.

00:00:34.028 --> 00:00:40.300 line:100%,end
Download the fleet CSV gathers the services
of every unit into one file.

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:46.300 line:100%,end
A clear service history also helps
when the unit is sold.
